             │  INPUT:  ℓ_t, R_t, σ_t^R, pk_I, P_t, P_{t+1}                  │
             │                                                               │
             │  ①  Verify σ_t^R with pk_I                                    │
             │                                                               │
             │  ②  Recompute H(P_t), H(P_{t+1}); compare to leaf              │
             │                                                               │
             │  ③  Compute inclusion path ℓ_t → R_t; verify                  │
             │                                                               │
             │  ④  If previous root R_{t'} presented (t' < t):               │
             │        verify consistency proof                               │
             │                                                               │
             │  OUTPUT:  VERIFIED  |  REJECTED                               │
             └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

             RFC 6962 standard for Merkle tree inclusion and consistency.
             Policy-hash binding ensures retroactive policy substitution
             is detectable.
